<title>AUSTRIA: Austria Natbank sets quick repo at 3 pct.</title>
<headline>Austria Natbank sets quick repo at 3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank said on Friday it was calling for bids on quick securities repurchase agreements at a fixed 3.0 percent.</p>
<p>Bids for the repos, which run from December 27-30, must be in by 1000 GMT.</p>
<p>Earlier the central bank called for bids in one-week repos, also at three percent.</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom, 43-1-53112-254</p>
</text>
